# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#typicalInfluenceOn
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#typicalInfluenceOn> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#typicalInfluenceOn> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-ontology> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#typicalInfluenceOn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Weak annotation relation indicating that a source concept, parameter, process, context factor or structural characteristic typically influences a target concept, without asserting a deterministic or universally valid causal relation."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#typicalInfluenceOn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#typicalInfluenceOn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "typical influence on"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#typicalInfluenceOn> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#modellingNote> "Use this property for cross-module class-level or concept-level links such as process parameter to structural characteristic, structure to durability, or context factor to durability. It is intentionally an annotation property to avoid strong OWL inferences over classes."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#typicalInfluenceOn> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#sourceLocator> "docs/decisions/TXT-DEC-006.md"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#typicalInfluenceOn> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#sourceType> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#projectDecision> .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#typicallyContributesTo
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#typicallyContributesTo> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#typicallyContributesTo> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-ontology> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#typicallyContributesTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Weak annotation relation indicating that a source entity typically contributes to, supports or participates in the realisation of a target characteristic, performance aspect or outcome."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#typicallyContributesTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#typicallyContributesTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "typically contributes to"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#typicallyContributesTo> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#modellingNote> "This is a specialised form of typical influence. It should not be interpreted as a necessary or sufficient condition."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#typicallyContributesTo> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#sourceLocator> "docs/decisions/TXT-DEC-006.md"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#typicallyContributesTo> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#sourceType> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#projectDecision> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#typicallyContributesTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#typicalInfluenceOn> .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#typicallyIncreasesLikelihoodOf
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#typicallyIncreasesLikelihoodOf> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#typicallyIncreasesLikelihoodOf> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-ontology> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#typicallyIncreasesLikelihoodOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Weak annotation relation indicating that a source entity typically increases the likelihood of a target degradation phenomenon, failure mode, damage mechanism or adverse outcome."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#typicallyIncreasesLikelihoodOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#typicallyIncreasesLikelihoodOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "typically increases likelihood of"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#typicallyIncreasesLikelihoodOf> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#modellingNote> "This property is appropriate for risk-like links, for example context or use factors increasing the likelihood of a durability failure mode."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#typicallyIncreasesLikelihoodOf> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#sourceLocator> "docs/decisions/TXT-DEC-006.md"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#typicallyIncreasesLikelihoodOf> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#sourceType> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#projectDecision> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#typicallyIncreasesLikelihoodOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#typicalInfluenceOn> .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#typicallyReducesLikelihoodOf
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#typicallyReducesLikelihoodOf> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#typicallyReducesLikelihoodOf> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-ontology> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#typicallyReducesLikelihoodOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Weak annotation relation indicating that a source entity typically reduces the likelihood of a target degradation phenomenon, failure mode, damage mechanism or adverse outcome."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#typicallyReducesLikelihoodOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#typicallyReducesLikelihoodOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "typically reduces likelihood of"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#typicallyReducesLikelihoodOf> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#modellingNote> "This property is appropriate for protective or mitigating links. It should not be interpreted as a guarantee of prevention."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#typicallyReducesLikelihoodOf> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#sourceLocator> "docs/decisions/TXT-DEC-006.md"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#typicallyReducesLikelihoodOf> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#sourceType> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#projectDecision> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#typicallyReducesLikelihoodOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#typicalInfluenceOn> .
